{
    "title": "eFHUB\u2122 25",
    "description": "This app is not a game.\r\n \r\nThis application features...\r\n \r\nPLAYER DATABASE\r\nFeaturing a complete player database with features such as\u2026\r\n\u2022\tThe ability to search for players using their stats at max level, not just level 1.\r\n\u2022\tCalculates the dribbling skills that each player can perform and shows controller animations on how to perform them.\r\n\u2022\tCalculates exactly how player condition affects player stats and overall rating.\r\n\u2022\tPlayer cards show the top 6 key stats of each player so you can quickly see each player\u2019s strong points.\r\n\u2022\tKeeps track of player condition throughout the season to help you make better decisions on who to level-up.\r\n\r\nMANAGER DATABASE\r\nFeaturing a manager database with features such as\u2026\r\n\u2022\tEasily see managers that have changed formation and tactics every week.\r\n\u2022\tSearch for managers by their attacking or defensive tactics.\r\n\u2022\tCustom formation search tool to assist you in finding the exact formation that you need.\r\n\r\nSQUAD BUILDER\r\nFeaturing a squad builder that is designed to help you learn and understand how to build a squad with high team strength and low contract cost. Features include\u2026\r\n\u2022\tTeam strength calculations which is ideal for building 2,3 and 4 star strength squads.\r\n\u2022\tSee how players can be positioned with different managers.\r\n\u2022\tSave an unlimited amount of squads.\r\n\u2022\tAuto squad build that will build a squad for you based on the parameters you choose.\r\n\u2022\tTotal squad contract cost.\r\n \r\nGAME PLAN\r\nGame Plan simulates player off the ball movement in attack and defence. This allows you to view any weak and strong points in your manager's tactics against other managers.\r\n \r\nHIDDEN GEM FINDER\r\nEasily find hidden gems with high potential and low contract renewal cost.\r\n \r\nMY TEAM\r\nSave your players and managers so that they are easily accessible for viewing or squad building.\r\n \r\nDRIBBLING SKILL TUTORIALS\r\nTutorials with controller animations showing you exactly how to perform dribbling skill move for console and mobile.\r\n\r\nThis is the app of eFOOTBALLHUB.\r\n \r\nDisclaimer,\r\nThis is an unofficial companion app. This application does not have any relation to any game. This app only provides tutorials and information for learning purposes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This app is not a game.<br> <br>This application features...<br> <br>PLAYER DATABASE<br>Featuring a complete player database with features such as\u2026<br>\u2022\tThe ability to search for players using their stats at max level, not just level 1.<br>\u2022\tCalculates the dribbling skills that each player can perform and shows controller animations on how to perform them.<br>\u2022\tCalculates exactly how player condition affects player stats and overall rating.<br>\u2022\tPlayer cards show the top 6 key stats of each player so you can quickly see each player\u2019s strong points.<br>\u2022\tKeeps track of player condition throughout the season to help you make better decisions on who to level-up.<br><br>MANAGER DATABASE<br>Featuring a manager database with features such as\u2026<br>\u2022\tEasily see managers that have changed formation and tactics every week.<br>\u2022\tSearch for managers by their attacking or defensive tactics.<br>\u2022\tCustom formation search tool to assist you in finding the exact formation that you need.<br><br>SQUAD BUILDER<br>Featuring a squad builder that is designed to help you learn and understand how to build a squad with high team strength and low contract cost. Features include\u2026<br>\u2022\tTeam strength calculations which is ideal for building 2,3 and 4 star strength squads.<br>\u2022\tSee how players can be positioned with different managers.<br>\u2022\tSave an unlimited amount of squads.<br>\u2022\tAuto squad build that will build a squad for you based on the parameters you choose.<br>\u2022\tTotal squad contract cost.<br> <br>GAME PLAN<br>Game Plan simulates player off the ball movement in attack and defence. This allows you to view any weak and strong points in your manager&#39;s tactics against other managers.<br> <br>HIDDEN GEM FINDER<br>Easily find hidden gems with high potential and low contract renewal cost.<br> <br>MY TEAM<br>Save your players and managers so that they are easily accessible for viewing or squad building.<br> <br>DRIBBLING SKILL TUTORIALS<br>Tutorials with controller animations showing you exactly how to perform dribbling skill move for console and mobile.<br><br>This is the app of eFOOTBALLHUB.<br> <br>Disclaimer,<br>This is an unofficial companion app. This application does not have any relation to any game. This app only provides tutorials and information for learning purposes.",
